sequenceDiagram
accTitle: RAM integration creates the role needed for OU sharing
accDescr: A management-account principal enables organization sharing through RAM. RAM initializes its organization integration before an owner creates a resource share targeting an OU.
participant M as Management account
participant R as AWS RAM
participant O as Organizations and IAM
participant A as Resource owner
M->>R: Enable organization sharing
R->>O: Enable integration and create service-linked role
O-->>R: Organization structure access available
R-->>M: Sharing enabled
A->>R: Create share with resources and OU principal
R->>O: Resolve OU membership
R-->>A: Share available to eligible member accounts
